## 🚀 How to Run the System

Open **2 terminals**:

### Terminal 1: Start Python gRPC Backend
```powershell
# 1. Compile proto files for Python
.\server-python\.venv\Scripts\python -m grpc_tools.protoc -Iproto --python_out=server-python --grpc_python_out=server-python proto/google/api/http.proto proto/google/api/annotations.proto proto/inventory.proto

# 2. Run the Python gRPC Server (listening on 50053)
.\server-python\.venv\Scripts\python server-python/server.py
```

### Terminal 2: Start Node.js HTTP Gateway
```powershell
# Run the Gateway Server (listening on 8080)
node gateway-node/gateway.js
```

