## 🔍 Verification Results

All 5 REST endpoints were tested programmatically against the running Python gRPC server via the Node Gateway and verified to work correctly:
- ✅ `GET /v1/products` (Server streaming gRPC -> HTTP JSON list)
- ✅ `GET /v1/products/prod-1` (Unary gRPC -> HTTP JSON object)
- ✅ `POST /v1/products` (HTTP JSON -> Unary gRPC AddProduct)
- ✅ `PUT /v1/products` (HTTP JSON -> Unary gRPC UpdateProduct)
- ✅ `DELETE /v1/products/prod-4` (HTTP JSON -> Unary gRPC DeleteProduct)
